--- errors ---
E-unit UnitMismatch 87..91 "10nF"
E-unit UnitMismatch 138..141 "47K" fix 138..141 "47k"
E-unit MixedUnits 188..195 "1V + 1A"
E-unit MixedUnits 242..254 "1V / 1mA + 5"
E-unit NotArithmetic 301..310 "10°C * 2"
E-value NotAValue 357..358 "p"
